        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>A Qualitative Study - Poster</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  body {\n    background-color: #f3f8e8;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 40px;\n  }\n  .poster-container {\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background-color: transparent;\n  }\n  \n  /* Header Section */\n  .header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    color: #3d83c7;\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  h1.main-title {\n    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', 'Impact', sans-serif;\n    color: #208b82;\n    font-size: 6rem;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 0.9;\n    transform: scaleY(1.1);\n  }\n  hr.main-line {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 4px solid #208b82;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .authors {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n\n  /* Typography */\n  h2 {\n    color: #208b82;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* Placeholders */\n  .placeholder {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n    border: 2px dashed #208b82;\n    color: #208b82;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* Section 1: Intro/Graphic/Method */\n  .sec-1 {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .sec-1 .col-text {\n    width: 27%;\n  }\n  .sec-1 .col-img {\n    width: 40%;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .v-line {\n    width: 2px;\n    background-color: #208b82;\n    margin: 0 15px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .main-graphic {\n    width: 320px;\n    height: 320px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* Section 2: Results */\n  .sec-2 {\n    background-color: #c7eed9;\n    padding: 35px;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .sec-2 h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .results-sub {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #3d83c7;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n  }\n  .results-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.1fr;\n  }\n  .r-cell {\n    padding: 25px 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n  }\n  .r-cell.border-r {\n    border-right: 2px solid #208b82;\n  }\n  .r-cell.border-b {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #208b82;\n  }\n  \n  .stat-num {\n    color: #3d83c7;\n    font-size: 4rem;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', 'Impact', sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    transform: scaleY(1.1);\n  }\n  .stat-icon {\n    width: 45px;\n    height: 80px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n  }\n  .stat-icon.wide {\n    width: 70px;\n  }\n  .stat-text {\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .chart-cell {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .chart-title {\n    color: #208b82;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n  }\n  .chart-body {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    width: 100%;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .legend {\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 5px;\n  }\n  .legend-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .color-box {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .bg-green { background-color: #208b82; }\n  .bg-blue { background-color: #3d83c7; }\n  .bg-white { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #ccc; }\n  .chart-placeholder {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 70px;\n    border-radius: 70px 70px 0 0;\n    align-self: flex-end;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Section 3: Discussion/Conclusion */\n  .sec-3 {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .sec-3 .col {\n    width: 47%;\n  }\n  .sec-3 ul {\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .sec-3 li {\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  /* Section 4: References */\n  .sec-4 {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .sec-4 h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .sec-4 hr {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 2px solid #208b82;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .ref-cols {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .ref-col {\n    width: 48%;\n  }\n  .ref-list {\n    list-style-type: circle;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .ref-list li {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .disclaimer {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"poster-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">Exploring Student Experiences in Virtual Learning Environments:</div>\n    <h1 class=\"main-title\">A QUALITATIVE STUDY</h1>\n    <hr class=\"main-line\">\n    <div class=\"authors\">John H., Kylie W., Rose S.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sec-1\">\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <h2>INTRODUCTION</h2>\n      <p>The shift to virtual learning has transformed education, yet students' lived experiences remain underexplored. This study investigates how students perceive virtual learning environments (VLEs), focusing on challenges, benefits, and overall engagement. The findings aim to inform improvements in digital education strategies.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"v-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"col-img\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder main-graphic\">\n        <div>[Diagram: Globe centered]</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size: 0.8rem;\">[Icons: Email, Images, User, Search, Music, Play]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"v-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <h2>METHODOLOGY</h2>\n      <p>This study used a qualitative phenomenological approach to examine the experiences of university students in virtual learning. Data were collected through 25 semi-structured interviews and three focus group discussions with students from diverse disciplines and academic levels. Participants were recruited via purposive sampling to ensure representation of varying levels of engagement with VLEs. Thematic analysis was conducted using NVivo software, with triangulation of interviews and focus groups to enhance validity.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sec-2\">\n    <h2>RESULTS</h2>\n    <div class=\"results-sub\">Quantitative insights were drawn from the thematic analysis to highlight key findings:</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"results-grid\">\n      <!-- Row 1 -->\n      <div class=\"r-cell border-r border-b\">\n        <div class=\"stat-num\">92%</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder stat-icon\">[Icon:<br>Person]</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-text\">of participants appreciated the flexibility of virtual learning</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"r-cell border-r border-b\">\n        <div class=\"stat-num\">68%</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder stat-icon wide\">[Icon:<br>Server]</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-text\">faced moderate to severe challenges with internet connectivity, particularly in rural areas</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"r-cell chart-cell\">\n        <div class=\"chart-title\">Challenges with Internet Connectivity</div>\n        <div class=\"chart-body\">\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box bg-green\"></div> No Issues</div>\n            <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box bg-blue\"></div> Moderate</div>\n            <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box bg-white\"></div> Severe</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">[Donut Chart]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Row 2 -->\n      <div class=\"r-cell border-r\">\n        <div class=\"stat-num\">76%</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder stat-icon\">[Icon:<br>Pen]</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-text\">of students felt disengaged during online classes due to limited interaction</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"r-cell border-r\">\n        <div class=\"stat-num\">85%</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder stat-icon wide\">[Icon:<br>Laptops]</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-text\">reported increased engagement, when breakout rooms were used effectively</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"r-cell chart-cell\">\n        <div class=\"chart-title\">Students Reporting Engagement Improvements with Breakout Rooms</div>\n        <div class=\"chart-body\">\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box bg-green\"></div> Engage</div>\n            <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"color-box bg-white\"></div> Not Engaged</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">[Donut Chart]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sec-3\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <h2>DISCUSSION</h2>\n      <p>The study highlights the dual-edged nature of virtual learning: while flexibility enhances accessibility, poor engagement and technical challenges hinder learning outcomes. These findings underscore the need for robust digital infrastructure, consistent use of engagement tools, and personalized support systems.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"v-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <h2>CONCLUSION</h2>\n      <p><strong>To improve virtual learning, institutions should:</strong></p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Provide comprehensive training for students and instructors on digital tools.</li>\n        <li>Standardize engagement practices, such as interactive discussions.</li>\n        <li>Enhance technical support services and address digital equity issues.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sec-4\">\n    <h2>REFERENCES</h2>\n    <hr>\n    <div class=\"ref-cols\">\n      <div class=\"ref-col\">\n        <ul class=\"ref-list\">\n          <li><strong>Smith, J. A., & Lee, K. H. (2021). Student engagement and motivation in virtual classrooms:</strong> A qualitative exploration. Journal of Educational Technology, 45(3), 215-229. https://doi.org/10.1234/jet.2021.0306</li>\n          <li><strong>Brown, R. T., & Miller, S. P. (2020). Navigating the digital divide:</strong> Challenges and opportunities in virtual learning environments. International Journal of Distance Education, 32(2), 98-112. https://doi.org/10.5678/ijde.2020.0205</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ref-col\">\n        <ul class=\"ref-list\">\n          <li><strong>Thompson, L. M., & Garcia, M. A. (2022). Perceptions of online learning:</strong> A case study of university students during the COVID-19 pandemic. Educational Psychology Review, 35(4), 341-356. https://doi.org/10.7890/epr.2022.0402</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"disclaimer\">\n          [All information here is for demonstration purposes and does not reflect actual data or outcomes.]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
